Dave Mehringer pointed out how annoying it is that dragons and other heavy 
beasties won't follow you in to your own temple.  Ah! but with dragons, at
least, you can LURE them in by dropping gold--at least, that happened 
for me the other day (by accident: I'd dropped some gold on the altar,
waiting to come back for a little chat when I had enough more; but when
I left the room, blindfolded and telepathic of course, I noticed that
dragon who'd been hanging about outside another door sneaked in to rob
the collection plate).

After all, even if you kill them in the temple, they're still too heavy to 
lift and carry to the altar: much better to kill them on the altar
if you can.


